{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e2-wei015-071","title":"张既讨伊健妓妾、治元多，进显美设伏破胡","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-fb0816ac3125f8a3026f","label":"正文","text":"卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ce06ab46d7b20a6bf426","label":"正文","text":"帝忧河西之乱，召邹岐，以张既代之","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"id":"liusima-a-eb58027d88c02e795e84","label":"正文","text":"帝诏张既谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事勿复先请","evidence":["liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb"]},{"id":"liusima-a-73c4204e3f857411b567","label":"正文","text":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继张既之后","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1"]},{"id":"liusima-a-2cc52acdac5812545073","label":"正文","text":"张既至金城力排众议渡河西进","evidence":["liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba"]},{"id":"liusima-a-3bfe498f1c98aeaacf1c","label":"正文","text":"贼骑逆拒鹯阴口，张既扬声鹯阴潜出揟次至武威，胡引还显美","evidence":["liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-ff7d56750ebe088a52a2","label":"正文","text":"张既据武威劳赐将士，力主进军，军显美","evidence":["liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"id":"liusima-a-47c4f6182e5aed76f3af","label":"正文","text":"胡骑数千因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","evidence":["liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8"]},{"id":"liusima-a-56c6808baa8864094778","label":"正文","text":"张既夜设伏兵，使成公英挑战佯退，大破胡，斩首获生以万数","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]},{"id":"liusima-a-68feef8b5164ebebd4b8","label":"正文","text":"帝诏褒张既破胡之功，徙封西乡侯增邑二百","evidence":["liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0002","role":"卢水胡，与治元多等反，河西大扰","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"忧之，称非既莫能安凉州，乃召邹岐，以既代之；诏既引贾复请击郾贼故事，称卿谋略过人今则其时，以便宜从事，勿复先请；遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等继既后；甚悦，诏褒既逾河历险、以劳击逸、以寡胜众，功过南仲勤逾吉甫，此勋永宁河右，徙封西乡侯","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"代邹岐统军，显美设伏破胡","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},{"person":"liusima-p0062","role":"被召还","evidence":["liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0025","role":"护军，受遣继既后；等犹未达","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0012","role":"将军，受遣继既后；继至武威","evidence":["liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"参军，督千余骑挑战佯退","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","related_events":[{"event":"wendi-e-p080a","type":"related","evidence":["liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","wendi-e-p080a-q"]}],"order":3304},{"id":"liusima-e-o205","title":"建安中韩约从华阴破走还湟中，部党散去，唯成公英独从","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-104bf831433380ce9c6e","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"建安中韩约从华阴破走还湟中，部党散去，唯成公英独从","evidence":["liusima-q-1506bb424940bf6ead39"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"从华阴破走还湟中，部党散去","evidence":["liusima-q-1506bb424940bf6ead39"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"唯英独从","evidence":["liusima-q-1506bb424940bf6ead39"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年