军师，封列侯","evidence":["liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"为军师，封列侯","evidence":["liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec","source_order":[15,179,303],"order":3309},{"id":"liusima-e-o210","title":"从猎射鹿三发三中，太祖叹韩文约可尽节，英跪答不欺明公而流涕","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-9a33b3e40beaa92a62c2","label":"裴注·典略","text":"从猎射鹿三发三中，太祖叹韩文约可尽节，英跪答不欺明公而流涕","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"命英射三鹿，抵掌称但韩文约可为尽节，而孤独不可乎；嘉其敦旧，遂亲敬之","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]},{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"三发三中皆应弦而倒，乃下马而跪曰不欺明公，假使英本主人在，实不来此也，遂流涕哽咽","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf","source_order":[15,179,319],"order":3310},{"id":"liusima-e-o211","title":"延康、黄初之际诏遣成公英佐凉州平陇右，病卒","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-8a8c31fc3e14bc535564","label":"裴注·典略","text":"延康、黄初之际诏遣成公英佐凉州平陇右，病卒","evidence":["liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0032","role":"河西有逆谋时，受诏遣佐凉州平陇右，病卒","evidence":["liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4","source_order":[15,179,419],"order":3311}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0032","name":"成公英","evidence":["liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","liusima-q-1506bb424940bf6ead39","liusima-q-bacf3ab1ef30b2b45609","liusima-q-4b207a53737952e1dc72","liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec","liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf","liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-037b7315ddb88169745e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既夜藏精卒三千人为伏，使参军成公英，督千余骑挑战，敕使佯退。胡果争奔之，因发伏，截其后；首尾进击，大破之，斩首获生以万数","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":143,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1506bb424940bf6ead39","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"建安中，约从华阴破走，还湟中。部党散去，唯英独从","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":30,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-295900b8d301562b62b8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"贼七千余骑。逆拒军于鹯阴口〖6〗。既扬声军由鹯阴〖7〗，乃潜由（且）〔揟〕次出至武威〖8〗。胡以为神，引还显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-2aa5898655c68d54735f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-09fc0acef808d7824108","layer":"original","quote":"帝甚悦，诏曰：“卿逾河历险，以劳击逸，以寡胜众；功过南仲〖10〗，勤逾吉甫〖11〗。此勋非但破胡，乃永宁河右：使吾长无西顾之念矣！”徙封西乡侯，增邑二百；并前四百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-4b207a53737952e1dc72","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"遂宿有恩于羌，羌卫护之。及夏侯渊还，使阎行留后。乃合羌胡数万，将攻行，行欲走。会遂死，英降太祖","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":255,"end":302,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-5b9878e0b144a9ab2c8f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"帝忧之，曰：“非既莫能安凉州。”乃召邹岐，以既代之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-78bda4e0e8487c740adb","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"诏曰：“昔贾复请击郾贼〖3〗，光武笑曰：‘执金吾击郾，吾复何忧？’卿谋略过人，今则其时。以便宜从事，勿复先请","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-91ba5079ad5d62bbedba","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8118e588c621947e4c3d","layer":"original","quote":"既至金城，欲渡河，诸将、守以为：“兵少道险，未可深入。”既曰：“道虽险，非井陉之隘；夷狄乌合，无左车之计〖5〗。今武威危急，赴之宜速！”遂渡河","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-99f08230202561e54ef1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"遣护军夏侯儒、将军费曜等，继其后","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":109,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-bacf3ab1ef30b2b45609","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"当从羌中，西南诣蜀耳。’英曰：‘兴军数十年，今虽疲败，何有弃其门而依于人乎？’遂曰：‘吾年老矣，子欲何施？’英曰：‘曹公不能远来，独夏侯尔。夏侯之众，不足以追我；又不能久留，且息肩于羌中，以须其去。招呼故人，绥会羌胡，犹可以有为也。’遂从其计","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":121,"end":242,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-c9388af0128950f3f5ec","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖见英甚喜，以为军师，封列侯","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":303,"end":318,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-cc785ead6b87673cf7bf","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"从行出猎，有三鹿走过前。公命英射之，三发三中，皆应弦而倒。公抵掌谓之曰：‘但韩文约可为尽节，而孤独不可乎？’英乃下马而跪曰：‘不欺明公。假使英本主人在，实不来此也。’遂流涕哽咽。公嘉其敦旧，遂亲敬之","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":319,"end":418,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-e02513496e51b61f3ac8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"胡骑数千，因大风欲放火烧营，将士皆恐","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":124,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-e42ba56b0080adb017a4","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-fe0f3567e6b3112d284b","layer":"pei","quote":"延康、黄初之际，河西有逆谋。诏遣英，佐凉州平陇右，病卒","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c64b31dc74be282c0ef8","start":419,"end":446,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-fa191a1adbe752162bb3","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-317ca5b514e793107c31","layer":"original","quote":"凉州卢水胡伊健妓妾、治元多等反〖2〗，河西大扰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-fb796c6c073763573d28","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-47e6be1e6d480e0b839e","layer":"original","quote":"既已据武威，曜乃至，儒等犹未达。既劳赐将士，欲进军击胡。诸将皆曰：“士卒疲倦，虏众气锐，难与争锋。”既曰：“今军无现粮，当因敌为资。若虏见兵合，退依深山；追之则道险穷饿，兵还则出候寇抄。如此，兵不得解，所谓‘一日纵敌，患在数世’也。”遂前，军显美","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-p080a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f526d1a1f2ac1dd03e36","layer":"pei","quote":"十一月辛未，镇西将军曹真命众将及州郡兵，讨破叛胡治元多、卢水封赏等。斩首五万余级，获生口十万，羊一百一十一万口，牛八万，河西遂平。","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dea0b21111fc3c1b95dd","start":10,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
